<section class="policy-page contact-page"><span class="micro">END CULTURE / CONTACT</span><h1>CONTACT</h1><div class="policy-copy"><p>Questions about an order, a product, a return or END CULTURE? Send us a message below.</p><p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@endculture.co.uk">info@endculture.co.uk</a></p>{% form 'contact' %}<input type="text" name="contact[name]" placeholder="NAME" required><input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="EMAIL" required><textarea name="contact[body]" placeholder="MESSAGE" rows="6" required></textarea><button type="submit">SEND MESSAGE →</button>{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p class="form-success">MESSAGE SENT. THANK YOU.</p>{% endif %}{{ form.errors | default_errors }}{% endform %}</div></section>{% schema %}{"name":"Contact","settings":[]}{% endschema %}